SUMMARY:Live Music with Songsmith at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Check out our amazing lineup up of musicians that will be perfo
 rming live right here at the farm! Join us on select Friday evenings and S
 aturdays for toe-tapping tunes from our favorite bands. Songsmith is the c
 reative collaboration of experienced musicians Steve Davis and Lynn Royer.
  Bringing talent\, experience\, and creativity to every performance\, Song
 smith is a breath of fresh air to the Central PA acoustic music scene. Pla
 ying an eclectic mix of covers\, arrangements\, and originals\, Songsmith 
 brings fun\, quality entertainment and industry professionalism to your ve
 nue or event. Lynn Royer: Vocals & Hand Percussion Lynn has provided excep
 tional vocal abilities to a number of musical projects- both acoustic and 
 electric and she has a beautiful tonal quality- both accurate and emotive.
  Her song writing skills are first-rate\, with several songwriting awards 
 to her credit. Lynn is also a teacher for children with special needs. Ste
 ve Davis: Guitar & Vocals Steve is a powerful acoustic and electric guitar
 ist employing tasteful use of live loop and other technologies (never prer
 ecorded) he has the ability to play in a wide range of styles. Steve also 
